	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "{{if:k==1|Un film|{{if:k==2|Un spectacle|{{if:k==3|Un match|Un voyage}}}}}} dure ${{a}}~\\text{h}~{{eval:5*t}}~\\text{min}$. Combien cela fait-il de minutes ?\n\nCela fait $?~\\text{min}$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "1..11"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:60*a+5*t}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$1~\\text{h} = 60~\\text{min}$, donc ${{a}}~\\text{h} = {{eval:60*a}}~\\text{min}$.",
					"${{eval:60*a}} + {{eval:5*t}} = {{eval:60*a+5*t}}$.",
					"Cela fait $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:60*a+5*t}}}~\\text{min}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "{{if:k==1|Un film|{{if:k==2|Un spectacle|{{if:k==3|Un match|Un voyage}}}}}} dure ${{eval:60*a+5*t}}~\\text{min}$. Écris cette durée en heures et en minutes.\n\nCela fait $?~\\text{h}~?~\\text{min}$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "1..11"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{a}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:5*t}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$60~\\text{min} = 1~\\text{h}$ : on cherche combien de fois $60$ minutes tiennent dans ${{eval:60*a+5*t}}$.",
					"${{eval:60*a+5*t}} = {{eval:60*a}} + {{eval:5*t}}$, et ${{eval:60*a}}~\\text{min} = {{a}}~\\text{h}$.",
					"Cela fait $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{a}}~\\text{h}~{{eval:5*t}}~\\text{min}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "{{if:k==1|La récréation|{{if:k==2|La séance de piscine|{{if:k==3|Le film|La promenade}}}}}} commence et finit aux heures montrées. Combien de temps a-t-{{if:k==3|il|elle}} duré ?\n\n```horloge\nheure: {{if:5*p==0|{{h}} h|{{h}} h {{eval:5*p}}}} ; {{if:mod(60*h+5*p+5*n,60)==0|{{eval:floor((60*h+5*p+5*n)/60)}} h|{{eval:floor((60*h+5*p+5*n)/60)}} h {{eval:mod(60*h+5*p+5*n,60)}}}}\nchiffres: tous\nlégendes: Début ; Fin\n```\n\nDurée : $?~\\text{min}$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "7..17"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "0..11"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "12..30"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:5*n}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Début : {{if:5*p==0|${{h}}~\\text{h}$|${{h}}~\\text{h}~{{eval:5*p}}$}}. Fin : {{if:mod(60*h+5*p+5*n,60)==0|${{eval:floor((60*h+5*p+5*n)/60)}}~\\text{h}$|${{eval:floor((60*h+5*p+5*n)/60)}}~\\text{h}~{{eval:mod(60*h+5*p+5*n,60)}}$}}.",
					"D'abord les heures : de {{if:5*p==0|${{h}}~\\text{h}$|${{h}}~\\text{h}~{{eval:5*p}}$}} à {{if:5*p==0|${{eval:h+floor(5*n/60)}}~\\text{h}$|${{eval:h+floor(5*n/60)}}~\\text{h}~{{eval:5*p}}$}}, il y a ${{eval:floor(5*n/60)}}~\\text{h} = {{eval:60*floor(5*n/60)}}~\\text{min}$.",
					"Puis les minutes : ${{eval:mod(5*n,60)}}~\\text{min}$.",
					"${{eval:60*floor(5*n/60)}} + {{eval:mod(5*n,60)}} = {{eval:5*n}}$.",
					"Cela fait $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:5*n}}}~\\text{min}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
